# The 46 Lean-emitted chain-link witnesses: ~150 MB of trace text against a repository whose
# largest tracked file is 10 MB. GENERATED, not tracked — emit them with the COMPILED exe
# (`lake env lean --run` costs 9m20s PER LINK, measured 2026-08-05):
#
#     cd metatheory && lake build mina_chain_emit \
#       && ./.lake/build/bin/mina_chain_emit ../circuit/tests/fixtures/pasta-fq-chainlink
#
# The 46 PUBLIC-INPUT vectors are tracked one directory up
# (`../pasta-fq-chainlink-pis.txt`) — they are small, and they are the objects the fold's
# continuity claim is about, so §0 of `mina_phase2_chain_fold.rs` runs with no emit at all.
link-*-trace.txt
link-*-pis.txt
chainlink-pis.txt
pasta-fq-chainlink.json
